  if (isHorizontal(axis)) {
    minDimensions[ id ] = PARTICIPANT_MIN_DIMENSIONS;
  } else {
    minDimensions[ id ] = {
      width: PARTICIPANT_MIN_DIMENSIONS.width,
      height: getParticipantMinHeight(shape, start)
    };
  }
}
```

But if the pool is empty, we should **not allow any vertical resizing** (i.e., the min and max height should be the same, or the min height should be strictly enforced).

